  "description": "Async pipeline runtime for .NET: resource-gated concurrency with adaptive/Bayesian tuning (and a pluggable custom-tuner hook, e.g. the always-learning EvalApp.Neural), sagas with compensation, middleware, and a fluent builder. One entry point, one namespace: `using EvalApp;` then `Eval.App(...)...` — the whole public surface lives directly in the EvalApp namespace, no `EvalApp.Consumer` to learn. The shared runtime for Evaluated Applications products.",
